{"type": "stdout", "timestamp": "2026-05-20T23:36:08.976774", "content": "<system>17 lines read from file starting from line 1. End of file reached.</system>     1\t{\"timestamp\": \"2026-05-17T07:20:25.771997+00:00\", \"round\": 3, \"hypothesis_id\": \"H001\", \"success\": true, \"summary\": \"H001 accepted: SA score threshold tightened (8.0→6.0) + ring count limit (max=7). Top-10 avg binding energy -7.761 kcal/mol (vs historical -7.986, +0.225), but 9/10 molecules have non-trivial synthesis routes with 1-step classic reactions. Synthetic feasibility significantly improved. Best molecule: Cc1cc(C)c2ccccc2c1O (-8.098, trivial, simple naphthalene derivative). All non-trivial routes use amide/sulfonamide/ether coupling - realistic building blocks. Trivial route ratio maintained at 10%.\"}\n     2\t{\"timestamp\": \"2026-05-17T15:39:04.358849+00:00\", \"round\": 1, \"hypothesis_id\": \"BASELINE\", \"success\": true, \"summary\": \"基线进化管线运行：对接引导进化（H002）生成 86 个独特分子，2 代进化后最佳结合能 -8.56 kcal/mol（前次最优 -8.098），Top 10 平均 -8.058，全部 10 个分子具备有效合成路线（8 个单步合成）。结合能下降 0.46 kcal/mol，路线覆盖率 100%。成功标准达成：最佳结合能 < -8.0 且全部路线有效。\"}\n     3\t{\"timestamp\": \"2026-05-17T16:52:21.710116+00:00\", \"round\": 3, \"hypothesis_id\": \"H009\", \"success\": true, \"summary\": \"H009 — Consensus Docking: Implemented dock_molecule_consensus() which runs 3 independent Vina dockings (seeds 42,123,456) and takes median energy. Applied to top-20 candidates (10 in quick run) after evolutionary generations — not during evolution to avoid cost blowup. Pipeline ran successfully: 59 unique molecules after 2 generations, top-10 re-scored with consensus, consensus std 0.004–0.063 kcal/mol confirms non-trivial stochastic noise. Best binding energy: -8.148 kcal/mol, avg: -7.890 kcal/mol. Key improvement: final ranking now uses consensus median instead of single-run score, eliminating random seed bias. Trivial route ratio: 3/5 (60%). Code is clean, backward-compatible, minimal risk.\"}\n     4\t{\"timestamp\": \"2026-05-17T18:01:06.137829+00:00\", \"round\": 4, \"hypothesis_id\": \"H004\", \"success\": false, \"summary\": \"H004 (fitness-proportionate selection + elite preservation) REJECTED. Best binding energy degraded from -8.56 to -8.43 kcal/mol, top-10 average from -8.058 to -7.901 kcal/mol. Key diagnosis: H002 docking guidance already applies top-k selection pressure; stacking H004 on top caused over-constraint and premature convergence. Additionally, sulfonamide-dominance in prior results reflects genuine target protein preference for SO2 motifs, not evolutionary drift. Chemical diversity improved but at the cost of binding affinity. Code changes preserved with # H004: markers for potential rollback or tuning in future rounds.\"}\n    [... truncated 14 lines of file content]"}
